ow it works, what it costs, and what happens if something isn&#39;t right.</p>","display_options":{"show_on":"all"},"styles":{"block_padding_top":0,"block_padding_right":0,"block_padding_bottom":0,"block_padding_left":0}}}]}]}]},{"content_type":"section","type":"section","data":{"properties":{},"display_options":{"show_on":"all"},"styles":{"background_color":"#FAF9F6","inner_padding_top":24,"inner_padding_right":24,"inner_padding_bottom":0,"inner_padding_left":24,"stack_on_mobile":true}},"rows":[{"data":{"styles":{"column_layout":"1-column-full-width"}},"columns":[{"blocks":[{"content_type":"block","type":"image","data":{"properties":{"dynamic":false,"asset_id":"384469683","src":"https://cdn.klaviyomail.com/company/Yh6N8Y/images/7f3264e3-fc70-4d04-896f-e9dfd7093449.png","href":"https://www.solkyst.ca/products/breast-cancer-blue-light-frame","alt_text":"Breast Cancer Blue Light frame"},"display_options":{"show_on":"all"},"styles":{"align":"center","full_width_mobile":true,"block_padding_top":0,"block_padding_right":0,"block_padding_bottom":0,"block_padding_left":0}}}]}]}]},{"content_type":"section","type":"section","data":{"properties":{},"display_options":{"show_on":"all"},"styles":{"background_color":"#FAF9F6","inner_padding_top":24,"inner_padding_right":24,"inner_padding_bottom":36,"inner_padding_left":24,"stack_on_mobile":true}},"rows":[{"data":{"styles":{"column_layout":"1-column-full-width"}},"columns":[{"blocks":[{"content_type":"block","type":"text","data":{"content":"<p style=\"text-align:center;font-family:'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6B6460;margin:0 0 14px;line-height:1.6\">October &middot; Breast Cancer Awareness Month</p><p style=\"text-align:center;font-family:Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;font-style:italic;font-size:34px;line-height:1.15;color:#1E1512;margin:0 0 6px\">The Breast Cancer<br>Blue Light</p><p style=\"text-align:center;color:#1E1512;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 16px\">A clear acetate frame with pink stainless steel wire and a ribbon charm.</p><p style=\"text-align:center;color:#1E1512;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 16px\">Choose a <b>blue light filter</b> lens ($200) or make them <b>readers in +1, +2 or +3</b> ($280). In Mini 135, Midi 145 or Wide 158mm.</p><p style=\"text-align:center;color:#1E1512;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 16px\">Every pair comes with a <b>free Kyst Klip</b>.</p><p style=\"text-align:center;font-family:Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;font-style:italic;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#6B6460;margin:0 0 12px\">A portion of every purchase goes to breast cancer research and support organizations.</p>","display_options":{"show_on":"all"},"styles":{"block_padding_top":0,"block_padding_right":0,"block_padding_bottom":0,"block_padding_left":0}}},{"content_type":"block","type":"button","data":{"content":"Shop the pink pair","properties":{"href":"https://www.solkyst.ca/products/breast-cancer-blue-light-frame"},"display_options":{"show_on":"all"},"styles":{"background_color":"transparent","color":"#3B2C27","border_color":"#3B2C27","border_style":"solid","border_width":2,"border_radius":0,"font_family":"'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif","font_size":13,"font_weight":"600","letter_spacing":2,"text_align":"center","inner_padding_top":14,"inner_padding_bottom":14,"inner_padding_left":34,"inner_padding_right":34,"block_padding_top":10,"block_padding_right":0,"block_padding_bottom":10,"block_padding_left":0}}}]}]}]},{"content_type":"section","type":"section","data":{"properties":{},"display_options":{"show_on":"all"},"styles":{"background_color":"#F4EEE8","inner_padding_top":40,"inner_padding_right":24,"inner_padding_bottom":36,"inner_padding_left":24,"stack_on_mobile":true}},"rows":[{"data":{"styles":{"column_layout":"1-column-full-width"}},"columns":[{"blocks":[{"content_type":"block","type":"text","data":{"content":"<p style=\"text-align:center;font-family:'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6B6460;margin:0 0 14px;line-height:1.6\">How prescription works</p><p style=\"text-align:center;font-family:Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;font-style:italic;font-size:34px;line-height:1.15;color:#1E1512;margin:0 0 6px\">Four steps.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-family:'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#1E1512;margin:0 0 14px\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;font-style:italic;font-size:24px;color:#3B2C27;padding-right:14px\">1</span><b>Choose your frame</b> from our prescription styles.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-family:'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#1E1512;margin:0 0 14px\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;font-style:italic;font-size:24px;color:#3B2C27;padding-right:14px\">2</span><b>Build your lenses:</b> single vision, readers or progressive, with blue light, tints, polarized or Transitions.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-family:'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#1E1512;margin:0 0 14px\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;font-style:italic;font-size:24px;color:#3B2C27;padding-right:14px\">3</span><b>Add your prescription.</b> Upload a photo, type it in, or email it after you order. You&#39;ll need your PD (pupillary distance).</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-family:'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#1E1512;margin:0 0 14px\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;font-style:italic;font-size:24px;color:#3B2C27;padding-right:14px\">4</span><b>Check out.</b> We check your prescription, our lab makes your lenses, and your order ships in 3&ndash;4 business days.</p>","display_options":{"show_on":"al